{"text": "**Zilliz Cloud Pricing Information:**\n\n**Free Tier:**\n- **Storage:** 5 GB\n- **vCUs per month:** 2.5M included\n- **Collections:** Up to 5\n- **Support:** Community support via Slack\n\n**Paid Tiers:**\n\n**Standard Plan:**\n- **Starting Price:** $0 (Serverless) / $126 (Dedicated) per month\n- **Features:**\n  - Fully managed vector databases with core APIs\n  - Backup, restore, and basic monitoring\n  - Built-in encryption for data in transit and at rest\n  - Community support: Slack invite link\n  - **Uptime SLA:** 99.95%\n\n**Enterprise Plan:**\n- **Starting Price:** $197 (Dedicated) per month\n- **Features:**\n  - 99.95% uptime SLA\n  - Audit logs, SSO (SAML 2.0 based), granular RBAC\n  - Multi-replica and elastic scaling\n  - Private endpoint and VPC peering\n  - On-demand Enterprise support included\n\n**Business Critical Plan:**\n- **Starting Price:** Contact for pricing\n- **Features:**\n  - Global cluster with high-level availability and disaster recovery\n  - Advanced security: CMEK and full-path in-transit encryption (edge TLS + internal)\n  - HIPAA-eligible with enhanced data privacy features\n  - Priority support and rapid incident response\n\n**On-demand Compute:**\n- **Features:**\n  - Zero-copy access to external data\n  - On-demand query jobs and system-managed index builds\n  - Pay only for active job runtime, with no always-on compute\n\n**BYOC (Bring Your Own Cloud):**\n- **Features:**\n  - Deploy on your infrastructure of choice\n  - High-level control and security\n  - Same features and experience as SaaS\n  - Dedicated clusters\n\n**Additional Features Across Plans:**\n- **Deployment Environment:** Shared, Dedicated\n- **Compute Scaling:** System-managed auto-scaling, Manual scaling up to 2,048 CUs\n- **High Availability:** Single, Multiple Availability Zones\n- **Uptime SLA:** 99.95%, 99.99% (if multi-replica is enabled)\n- **Data Security & Compliance:** OAuth 2.0, Enterprise SSO, Customer managed encryption keys (CMEK), MFA, Auditing, API key management, Data encryption in transit and at rest, etc.\n- **Observability:** Fine-grained metrics with real-time monitoring dashboards, Alerts, Alerting and monitoring integrations, Job Center, Role-based Access Control\n- **Integrations and Tools:** Intuitive RESTful APIs, User-friendly SDKs in multiple programming languages, VTS (Vector Transport Service), VectorDBBench Support\n- **Support:** Community Support, Email/Ticket portal, Slack private channel, Zoom/Google Meet/Teams, Assigned support engineers, Architectural Guidance, General Use-case specific, Code reviews, Live consultations\n\n**Compute Unit (CU):**\n- A group of hardware resources for serving your indexes and search requests.\n\n**vCU (Virtual Compute Unit):**\n- Used to measure the resources consumed by read operations (such as search and query) and write operations (such as insert, upsert, and delete).\n\n**Cluster Types:**\n- **Performance-optimized:** Ideal for real-time applications requiring instant search results and high concurrent traffic.\n- **Capacity-optimized:** Suited for managing large datasets with moderate search performance requirements.\n- **Tiered-storage:** Best for ultra-large-scale, cost-sensitive workloads.\n\n**Capacity Estimates:**\n- **Performance-optimized:** Supports up to 2 million 768-dimensional vectors.\n- **Capacity-optimized:** Supports up to 8 million 768-dimensional vectors.\n- **Tiered-storage:** Supports up to 40 million 768-dimensional vectors.\n\n**Discounts:**\n- When you commit to an annual plan, you can get additional credits based on your usage.\n\n**New Cloud Region Request:**\n- To request a new cloud service provider region for Zilliz Cloud, please fill out the form.\n"}